        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void Application::Run</definition>
        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>Run</name>
        <qualifiedname>Application::Run</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Runs the main game loop until the engine is stopped. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Main game loop.</para>
<para>The loop processes events, updates all systems, and renders the current scene.</para>
<para>The loop runs while the engine is running, processing events, updating all systems, and rendering the current scene. It follows a strict order starting from time then event handling, system updates, input state, rendering. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
