        <detaileddescription>
<para>This method ensures that all subsystems (graphics, audio, input, etc.) are properly cleaned up before exiting the application.</para>
<para>The shutdown order is the reverse of initialization to ensure proper resource cleanup and avoid dangling references. </para>
